                  "note": "Alert and busy: cf_is_interactive_challenge_present(tab, timeout=2) was stuck at cloudflare.py:120 (cf_wait_for_interactive_challenge -> cf_find_interactive_challenge -> DOM.getDocument). tab.verify_cf(timeout=2) was stuck at Tab.verify_cf tab.py:1666 on DOM.getDocument. Both were still pending after 8s. Busy 12s: cf_present returned False after 11.70s and verify_cf raised TimeoutError after 11.70s, both with timeout=2. The click-loop phase was not tested against a blocked renderer; the unbounded click_delay is covered under A11.4."
                },
                {
                  "fid": "A11.4",
                  "verdict": "confirmed",
                  "note": "Real Chromium page with a closed shadow root that holds <iframe src='about:blank%23challenges.cloudflare.com'> plus an empty input[name=cf-turnstile-response]; the challenge was detected. verify_cf(timeout=1, click_delay=4) raised 'Could not solve the checkbox in 1 seconds' only after 4.02s with 1 click. verify_cf(timeout=2, click_delay=0.1) raised after 2.01s with 19 clicks. The deadline is checked only at the top of the click loop in cloudflare.verify_cf, and asyncio.sleep(click_delay) is not bounded. The scan overrun is shown by the busy-12s runs (11.7s for timeout=2)."
                },
                {
                  "fid": "A5.7",
