                  "note": "Reproduced on repo code (Python 3.13.16) with real headless Chromium: `await br.update()` and `br.query_selector('x')` on <br clear=all>, str() of a div wrapping <my-list items=...>, span.get('id') on <span get=g>, tab.get_all_urls() with <a items=3 href=...>, and br.get_js_attributes().clear() all raise TypeError 'str' object is not callable. In the pure probe, cd.items(), cd.get(), cd.keys(), cd.values() and cd.clear() raise the same way. Every case works on the prototype. I did not run the cloudflare attrs.get('style') path separately, but it is the same attrs.get code path."
