                  "note": "Confirmed for both Browser and Connection: JSONDecodeError, UnicodeDecodeError, ConnectionClosedError and ExceptionGroup all become TypeError, and ProtocolException loses .code. The sys.exit case is confirmed with a subprocess running `async with zd.Browser(...): sys.exit(3)`: on repo code it exits with status 1 and prints '3' to stderr; on the prototype it exits with 3. I did not test CalledProcessError or IncompleteReadError separately; they fail by the same mechanism (multi-argument constructor)."
