                },
                {
                  "claim": "Chrome leaves .org.chromium.Chromium.* socket directories in TMPDIR after SIGTERM, whether or not the profile is shared",
                  "status": "verified",
                  "how": "I saw them in the TMPDIR of both the control run and the repr run. They are unrelated to this group."
                }
