                  "how": "Not reproduced. 15 trials of each on real headless Chromium with py3.13 on repo code: page.close ok 15/15, and 15/15 raised ProtocolException('target session was detached') with no hang. These two are shown only with a fake peer that coalesces the frames"
                }
