                "risks": "Not assessed (reproduce lens). The obvious fix is to skip find_executable in Config.__init__ when host and port are both set, or to make browser_executable_path resolve lazily. The catch: create_from_undetected_chromedriver sets conf.host and conf.port after Config(), so it needs its own handling, for example a lazy property or passing host/port into the constructor. browser_executable_path is typed as a PathLike attribute, so leaving it None needs a typing and mypy check."
