              "evidence": "Scripts in /tmp/claude-0/-home-user-zendriver/b2021b39-94e6-5220-9e66-7f33c0314a80/scratchpad/verify/BB-refute/: enum_r27.py (browser-free) lists UNRESOLVED BluetoothEmulation, DeviceAccess, DOMSnapshot, DOMStorage, FedCm, HeadlessExperimental, HeapProfiler, IndexedDB, LayerTree, PerformanceTimeline, ServiceWorker, SmartCardEmulation, WebAudio, WebAuthn and WebMCP, with each one's enable() required/optional params. probe_r27.py (headless Chromium, Python 3.13.16): enable-first sent [('FedCm.enable', {}), ('WebAuthn.enable', {}), ('WebAuthn.getCredentials', ...)] and getCredentials still returned [] (the authenticator survived). handler-first sent only WebAuthn.getCredentials.",
