              "refinements": "The fix belongs in filter_recurse only. Changing filter_recurse_all as well would change text_all and cloudflare's shadow-host scan, and would duplicate nested-iframe hits (Element.children already enters content_document). Element.text must opt out: without the opt-out, <div><iframe srcdoc='<p>inside</p>'></iframe>tail</div>.text changes from 'tail' to 'inside' (verified on Chromium). R28 must ship with the R36 dedup, or A5.9 becomes [span, span] and nested iframes give [B, B] (verified). A5.5(b) belongs with R29/A8.8.",
