                "diff_summary": "util.filter_recurse gains a keyword-only include_frames: bool = True. After the shadow-root check, a child that is an isinstance(child, cdp.dom.Node) with a content_document is searched recursively. Element children are skipped because Element.children already returns the iframe document. The flag is passed down the recursion. Element.text calls filter_recurse(..., include_frames=False). filter_recurse_all is unchanged. 28 changed lines (diff in BC-fixsafety/pkg_R28.diff).",
                "regression_test_path": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-zendriver/b2021b39-94e6-5220-9e66-7f33c0314a80/scratchpad/verify/BC-fixsafety/test_r28_iframe_tree.py",
