                "diff_summary": "tab.py only. (1) Tab.query_selector returns None when an IFRAME _node has content_document None, mirroring query_selector_all. (2) In both query_selector and query_selector_all, any ProtocolException not handled by a 'could not find node' retry now falls through to 'await self.disable_dom_agent(); raise', for the element-scoped branch too. (3) After the query, results found by walking an Element are unwrapped (node = node.node). When the scope is a non-IFRAME Element (doc is _node) with a tree, results get tree=_node.tree, the full document; otherwise tree=doc. (4) In the find_elements_by_text iframe branch, text_node.node is used only for Element results and raw cdp Nodes are passed as-is. 35 changed lines (diff in BC-fixsafety/pkg_R29.diff).",
