                "diff_summary": "tab.py. find_elements_by_text: new kwarg return_enclosing_element: bool = True. A text node is replaced by its parent only when the flag is True; otherwise the text node itself is appended, and the iframe branch extends iframe_text_elems. At the end, an order-preserving dedup by backend_node_id; then, if tag_hint is set, items are filtered to item.tag == tag_hint.strip().lower(). find_element_by_text forwards return_enclosing_element. query_selector_all: the iframe content_document collection moves out of 'if not _node' so it also runs on the stale retry, which passes the fresh doc as _node. The per-iframe try/except print is removed, so a stale iframe id goes through the existing one-shot retry. 63 changed lines (diff in BC-fixsafety/pkg_R36.diff).",
