                  "note": "tab_b.set_download_path(dirB) and download_file('first.txt') land in dirB. Then `async with tab_a.expect_download(): pass`. tab_b._download_behavior still says ['allow', dirB], but tab_b.download_file('second.txt') lands in ~/Downloads, not dirB. HOME was redirected to a scratch dir, so this ~/Downloads is home/Downloads in scratch."
                },
