              "summary": "All four members reproduce. A11.2 is real and the most serious one. In verify_cf.check_input, `await input_el` (Element.update, which does DOM.resolveNode on the old backendNodeId) raises when the solved challenge page navigates away. The intended 'input disappeared, so it was solved' branch therefore never runs. I showed this with real headless Chromium. The three proxy members (TLS upstream tunnel never torn down, non-ProxyError ValueError/UnicodeError escaping _handle_client with an empty reply, timeout reported as 'proxy closed the connection') all reproduce with in-process fake proxies. Small local fixes fix all four, and nothing regresses in the repo's own tests.",
